# design-lint baseline. Counts only go down: `make lint` lowers them.
# Raising one needs `make lint-rebaseline`, DESIGN_LINT_ALLOW_RAISE=1 on push, and a PR note.
version 1
format on
font-size 48
padding-literal 13
spacing-literal 14
radius-literal 19
hex-color 3
raw-color 7
raw-control off AppKit implements the kit controls
file-length 5
try-bang 0
force-cast 0
force-unwrap 1
print 0
opacity-literal 238
frame-literal 48
chamfer-literal 105
motion-literal 6
